            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The computer desktop use in the standby/sleep mode includes the share of computer production (CPU, keyboard, mouse, CRT) as well as the energy consumption (use-phase) and the rail and road transport from factory to user. Energy consumption of computer CPUs and CRT monitors (use-phase) vary a lot depending on the computer looked at. Min.-Max. values are listed;
Synonyms: PC; 
UUID: 58ef0ed8-67b5-371c-a346-e7194e4a50a3</common:generalComment>
