        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">No technology involved, except for the production of the desktop computer (including CRT, keyboard and mouse), which is described in another dataset.\n\n# Included processes\nDescribes the use of a desktop computer with a CRT monitor in the standby/sleep mode. Calculated per 1 hour of computer use. Computer life span assumed to be 4 years, for the CRT monitor 6 years. Standby/sleep mode 2 hours a day (office use), 240 days a year. UCTE production mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
